<title>USA: Loyola University, La., $45 mln bond repriced.</title>
<headline>Loyola University, La., $45 mln bond repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said Wednesday it repriced Louisiana Public Facilities Authority's $45 million bond deal for Loyola University. The top yield was 5.731 percent in 2016.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>LOUISIANA PUBLIC FACILITIES AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $45,000,000*</p>
<p>REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>(LOYOLA UNIVERSITY PROJECT)</p>
<p>SERIES 1997</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		 S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>		 (A1 CONFIRMED)	   (A+ CONFIRMED)</p>
<p>MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 01/01/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 10/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 10/01</p>
